<title>USA: Northrop clears antitrust wait for Logicon.</title>
<headline>Northrop clears antitrust wait for Logicon.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northrop Grumman Corp said Monday that the waiting period under the Hart-Scott-Rodino federal antitrust Act had expired for its proposed merger with Logicon Inc.</p>
<p>Northrop and Logicon have agreed to a merger pact giving Logicon stockholders .6161 shares of Northrop Grumman common stock for each Logicon share.</p>
<p>Logicon shareholders are scheduled to vote on the deal July 17.</p>
</text>
